================================================================
Reproducing this file
================================================================

    cargo install cargo-license
    cargo license --avoid-dev-deps --avoid-build-deps

No bundled model weights (Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, the pplx-embed/GTE-reranker
helper models, or the vision mmproj sidecar) are part of this
repository or its release artifacts (spec §266's "no bundled
Qwen/helper weights") — all are downloaded and checksum-verified at
first run per each checkpoint's own upstream license (see
`src/source/pinned.rs` for the pinned source URLs and hashes).
